# After typing a page of meeting notes, undoing all the way restores the original file exactly, and redoing all the way brings every note back.
file <<END
Meetings:
	Standup 1 Oct
		All good
END
keys G # o
type Planning 8 Oct
keys <Enter> <Tab>
type Attendees: Ann, Bob
keys <Enter>
type Decision ship on Friday
keys <C-b> <Enter>
type - Ann writes the notes
keys <Enter> <Tab>
type by Monday
keys <Enter> <S-Tab> <S-Tab>
type Next steps
keys <Esc>
see ▌   - Next steps
keys z z z z z z z z z z z z z z z z z z z z
see ▌   Standup 1 Oct
hide Planning
saved <<END
Meetings:
	Standup 1 Oct
		All good
END
keys Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z
see ▌   - Next steps
quit
saved <<END
Meetings:
	Standup 1 Oct
		All good
	Planning 8 Oct
		Attendees: Ann, Bob
		Decision ship on **Friday**
		- Ann writes the notes
			- by Monday
	- Next steps
END
